# BeaconChain Component

Client adapter for fetching Ethereum validator data from beaconcha.in API with rate limiting and batch processing.

## Key Integration Pattern
HTTP client with configurable rate limiting and batch processing to efficiently query validator states while respecting API limits.

## Important Constraints
- Enforce API rate limits through MaxRequestsPerMinute configuration
- Use batch requests to minimize API calls (default batch size: 100)
- Always include proper error handling for API responses and network failures